{"id":"nadezhda","lemma":"надежда","pos":"noun","rank":1211,"glosses":["hope, expectation, prospect"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8b/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%B6%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%B6%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"надежды","plural":"надежды"},"examples":[{"text":"Надежда всегда есть.","en":"There's always hope.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/196128","words":[null,{"g":"always"},{"g":"there is / to eat"}]},{"text":"Моё сердце полно надежды.","en":"My heart is full of hope.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"мой"},{"g":"heart"},{"g":"fully, in full"},null]},{"text":"Там, где есть жизнь, есть надежда.","en":"Where there's life, there's hope.","words":[{"g":"there"},{"g":"where"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},{"g":"life"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},null]},{"text":"Чем была бы жизнь без надежды?","en":"What would life be without hope?","words":[{"g":"than"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"would"},{"g":"life"},{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"Это моя единственная надежда.","en":"It's my only hope.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"my","l":"мой"},{"g":"sole, only, unique","l":"единственный"},null]}]}